314	 * figure its person's last statement bound it to, else its live due (amount times the rate in force on its date of
315	 * the grade its person had on its date, rounded half to even, and at least the sheet's floor; none — n/a — when no rate applies then). An
316	 * overdue claim's due adds, on top of its figure, the late charge: the sheet's late percent of the figure for every
317	 * full 30 days it is overdue on the sheet's today, rounded like a due. A statement never binds the charge; settling
318	 * freezes it in.
319	 */
320	public class ClaimFigures {
321	
322	    private final List<Rate> rates;
323	
324	    private final PersonGrades grades;
325	
326	    private final BigDecimal floor;
327	
328	    private final BigDecimal latePct;
329	
330	    private final int terms;
331	
332	    private final LocalDate today;
